``` LF-09 | Deployment Clients Not Phoning Home or Failing App Installs
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry LF-09. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: DS for the phone-home history (it is in the DS's own
    splunkd_access).
    Query: App install failures reported by clients (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-09-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
```
index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd earliest=-24h
    (component=DeployedApplication OR component=DeploymentClient
     OR component=DC*)
    (log_level=WARN OR log_level=ERROR)
| rex field=_raw "\]\s+-\s+(?<msg>.+)$"
| eval msg_sig=replace(msg, "\d+", "N")
| stats count dc(host) as clients values(host) as sample_clients
        latest(_time) as last_seen
        by component msg_sig
| eval sample_clients=mvindex(sample_clients, 0, 4)
| convert ctime(last_seen)
| sort - clients
